{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24107","headline":"春游 · 白居易","name":"春游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上马临出门，出门复逡巡。\n回头问妻子，应怪春游频。\n诚知春游频，其奈老大身。\n朱颜去复去，白发新更新。\n请君屈十指，爲我数交亲。\n大限年百岁，几人及七旬。\n我今六十五，走若下坂轮。\n假使得七十，祗有五度春。\n逢春不游乐，但恐是痴人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}